nt Dina Titus (D) is running."]}, "overview": "Democratic Rep. Dina Titus seeks another term in a Las Vegas-area district with a modest Democratic lean. No public general-election polls are available, so the picture rests on fundamentals and outside assessments. Most race raters call the contest Likely Democratic, with several rating it Safe or Solid Democratic and one placing it at Lean Democratic.\n\nPrediction markets put Titus's chances around 95 percent. The 2026 national environment favors Democrats, and incumbency adds to her position. Republican Carrie Buck has out-raised Titus and drawn attention as a strong recruit, and party committees on both sides have targeted the district, which keeps the race from being a complete afterthought. The combined evidence still points to a clear Democratic advantage.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9567, "margin": 11.7}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9528, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9532, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9485, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9322, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9231, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9459, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9435, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9451, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9532, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9504, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9435, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9463, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9234, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9304, "margin": 10.8}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9333, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9462, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9264, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9326, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9317, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "